      "widgets_values": [
        "Reuse a ColorLab look as a preset.\n\nColorLab's second output, params_json, holds every setting you changed. Connect it to Apply ColorLab Preset to put the same look on other photos or a whole batch, with a strength slider (0 = original, 1 = same as ColorLab, up to 2). You can also connect it to another ColorLab's params_json input: its sliders then add on top of the preset."
